            <ArticleTitle>[Electrophysiological changes in a complex treatment of lumbosacral pain syndrome in patients of different age group].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>53-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The influence of two methods of treatment (pharmacological and combination with infra-red laser puncture and manual therapy) on clinical picture, electromyographic indices in 165 patients of different age group with lumbosacral radiculitis has been studied by the author. The use of these methods in treatment of such patients is substantiated by the obtained data.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
